    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a base Windows application window. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides functionality for registering a window class, creating and displaying a window, updating its state, and processing Windows messages.</para>
<para>Designed to be extended by derived window classes. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
